      "created_at": "2014-11-19T14:39:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The word instead on Null Point is the key. &nbsp;Null Point cancels Spite's damage and replaces it with an equal amount of HP recovery. &nbsp;Because HP was not reduced by the attack Spite dealt no damage.</p><p>It sounds like a pretty epic beat-down, which are the best kind when dealing with Spite.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
